{
  "comment": "Why: the spatial sectors are about space that is not solid, so their encounters arrive close and from the side: endermites out of the wall, vexes through it, shulkers in it, and endermen when a party is loud enough to tear it. Cultists (illusioners, evokers, witches) are the people who built the doors.",
